cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "trajectory-lineage: controlled trajectory-family overlap audits"
message: "If you reference this software, please cite the repository."
type: software
authors:
  - name: Physical Reasoning
repository-code: "https://github.com/physicalreasoning/trajectory-lineage"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - world models
  - training data
  - video prediction
  - data lineage
  - evaluation leakage
abstract: >-
  A research scaffold for controlled experiments that separate exact-render,
  same-trajectory, nearby-trajectory, and independent-event relationships in
  video world-model evaluation. The repository is a conceptual pilot and does
  not claim empirical findings or identify proprietary training data.
